{"about_the_game":"<strong>Politics The Game</strong><br><br>It's high time to claw your way to the top!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/GIF1_EN.gif?t=1744375225\" /><br><br><strong>Politics The Game</strong> is the first RPG that lets you become your favorite parliamentarian, create the most powerful party in Poland, and lead it to power!<br><br>However, it won't be easy - you must take care of not only your popularity but also your human dignity. Your character can endure a lot, but if they lose self-respect, they will have to step down!<br><br>Make use of awesome special powers:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Critical attack using a battle cat? Absolutely!<br></li><li>German agent curse that reduces the popularity of the attacked? Of course.<br></li><li>Evacuating units weakened by fights at the festival using a police Black Hawk? You bet!</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/ENG_GIF2.gif?t=1744375225\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 parliamentarians with different stats and special skills<br></li><li>Freedom to create your own political party<br></li><li>Unique humor<br></li><li>A storyline referring to current events in national politics</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999060/extras/ENG_GIF1.gif?t=1744375225\" /><br><br><strong>Politics The Game</strong> has a low entry barrier. The rules can be understood even by a moderately bright left-wing MP, but to achieve perfection at the highest difficulty level, you'll need the strategic genius of Jaros\u0142aw himself.<br><br>Add <strong>Politics The Game</strong> to your wishlist so you don't miss the release!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2999060?t=1744375225","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st